stack\n27. Rozkaz k poslani dat z 3. registru\n28. Rozkaz k poslani dat z 2. registru\n29. Rozkaz k poslani dat z 1. registru\n--- kabel na nic (red)\n30.\n31. prepnuti na praci s operacemi\n32. data cte obrazovka\n33.\n34. rozkaz k poslani znaku z klavesnice\n35. data posila klavesnice\n36.\n37.\n38. data cte osa Y obrazovky\n39. data cte osa X obrazovky\n40. enter na obrazovce\n\nDISPLAY (fake ASCII)\n\n~/Programming/python/VCB ❯ /bin/python /home/vojta/Programming/python/VCB/latters/create_manual.py\n00000000 =>\n00000001 => \\n\n00000010 => \n00000011 => \n00000100 => \n00000101 => \n00000110 => \n00000111 => \n00001000 => 0\n00001001 => 1\n00001010 => 2\n00001011 => 3\n00001100 => 4\n00001101 => 5\n00001110 => 6\n00001111 => 7\n00010000 => 8\n00010001 => 9\n00010010 => A\n00010011 => B\n00010100 => C\n00010101 => D\n00010110 => E\n00010111 => F\n00011000 => G\n00011001 => H\n00011010 => I\n00011011 => J\n00011100 => K\n00011101 => L\n00011110 => M\n00011111 => N\n00100000 => O\n00100001 => P\n00100010 => Q\n00100011 => R\n00100100 => S\n00100101 => T\n00100110 => U\n00100111 => V\n00101000 => W\n00101001 => X\n00101010 => Y\n00101011 => Z\n00101100 => (space)\n00101101 => +\n00101110 => -\n00101111 => /\n00110000 => =\n00110001 => .\n00110010 => ,\n00110011 => ?\n00110100 => !\n\n\n\nPOZNAMKY\nspecialni mista v RAM\n\t- 00 00 00 01 - vraci random sekvenci (nejlze do nej zapsat)\n\t- 00 00 00 10 - cas od spusteni (nezapsatelna)\n\t- 00 00 00 11 - cas od spusteni (nezapsatelna)\n\t\n\t\n- pokud pridas cislo do operace je treba jeste zazadat o poslani a urcit do ktereho vysledku bude ulozen vysledek\n- draty: \n\torange - data\n\tgreen - informace o konci operace\n\twhite - kontrola pro if\n\tyellow - zbytek\n- pro operace plati ze vzdy je prvni mensi regist \n   eg. 1r - 2r, 2r - 3r, 1r - 3r \n   ale daji se prohodit pomoci 17\n- pismena jsou 6*8\n- display je 41*32 znaku",
